{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "microlend-automated-collection",
    "name": "MicroLend API — Automated Workflow",
    "description": "Fully automated MicroLend API collection.\n\nAUTOMATION:\n1. Auto-save tokens — a collection-level Test script inspects every response; when a login/reset returns a token it is saved to the matching per-role variable (admin_token, field_officer_token, credit_officer_token, branch_manager_token, collections_officer_token, borrower_token) based on the returned role. Returned IDs (centre_id, group_id, borrower_id, application_id, sanction_id, loan_account_id, receipt_id, case_id, kyc_id, loan_product_id) are captured automatically too.\n2. Auto-switch by role — the collection uses Bearer {{current_token}} for auth, and each request/folder sets current_token to the token of the role that owns it via a tiny pre-request script. You never copy a token manually.\n\nHOW TO USE:\n- Select the 'MicroLend - Dev Environment' environment.\n- Run the 'End-to-End Workflow' folder top-to-bottom for a full demo, OR\n- Use 'API Library' for ad-hoc calls (authenticate the role once via its login+reset, then any request in that role's folder just works).\n\nNote: the KYC upload request needs a file selected manually (Postman cannot attach a binary automatically).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{current_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Collection pre-request: intentionally empty. Role token switching is done per folder/request."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// === MicroLend global automation: auto-save tokens (by role) + common IDs ===",
          "var res;",
          "try { res = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { res = null; }",
          "if (res && typeof res === 'object' && !Array.isArray(res)) {",
          "  var roleToken = {",
          "    NBFC_ADMIN: 'admin_token',",
          "    FIELD_OFFICER: 'field_officer_token',",
          "    CREDIT_OFFICER: 'credit_officer_token',",
          "    BRANCH_MANAGER: 'branch_manager_token',",
          "    COLLECTIONS_OFFICER: 'collections_officer_token',",
          "    BORROWER: 'borrower_token'",
          "  };",
          "  if (res.token) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('current_token', res.token);",
          "    if (res.forcePasswordReset === true) {",
          "      pm.environment.set('reset_token', res.token);",
          "    } else if (res.role && roleToken[res.role]) {",
          "      pm.environment.set(roleToken[res.role], res.token);",
          "      pm.environment.set('active_role', res.role);",
          "      console.log('Saved ' + roleToken[res.role] + ' for role ' + res.role);",
          "    }",
          "  }",
          "  var idMap = {",
          "    productId: 'loan_product_id', centreId: 'centre_id', groupId: 'group_id',",
          "    kycId: 'kyc_id', applicationId: 'application_id', sanctionId: 'sanction_id',",
          "    loanAccountId: 'loan_account_id', scheduleId: 'schedule_id',",
          "    receiptId: 'receipt_id', caseId: 'case_id', userId: 'user_id'",
          "  };",
          "  Object.keys(idMap).forEach(function (k) {",
          "    if (res[k] !== undefined && res[k] !== null) pm.environment.set(idMap[k], res[k]);",
          "  });",
          "  if (res.borrower && res.borrower.borrowerId) pm.environment.set('borrower_id', res.borrower.borrowerId);",
          "  if (res.portalEmail) pm.environment.set('borrower_portal_email', res.portalEmail);",
          "  if (res.sanctionLetter && res.sanctionLetter.sanctionId) pm.environment.set('sanction_id', res.sanctionLetter.sanctionId);",
          "}",
          "pm.test('HTTP status < 400 (got ' + pm.response.code + ')', function () {",
          "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.below(400);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "End-to-End Workflow",
      "description": "Runnable full lending lifecycle. Press Run on this folder. Tokens and IDs flow automatically.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Phase 1 · Admin Setup",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "1.1 Admin Login (returns reset-scoped token)",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{default_seed_password}}\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "1.2 Admin Reset Password (returns FULL admin token)",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('reset_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{permanent_password}}\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/reset-password"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "1.3 Admin Create Loan Product",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('admin_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"productName\": \"Group General Loan\",\n  \"category\": \"GROUP_LENDING\",\n  \"minAmount\": 5000.00,\n  \"maxAmount\": 50000.00,\n  \"tenureMonths\": 12,\n  \"interestRatePercent\": 14.50,\n  \"interestType\": \"REDUCING_BALANCE\",\n  \"processingFeePercent\": 1.00,\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/loan-products"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Phase 2 · Field Officer Onboarding",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "2.1 Field Officer Login",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{fo_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{default_seed_password}}\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "2.2 Field Officer Reset Password",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('reset_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{permanent_password}}\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/reset-password"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "2.3 Create Centre",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('field_officer_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"centreName\": \"Centre Alpha 1\",\n  \"village\": \"Village East\",\n  \"meetingDay\": \"MONDAY\",\n  \"meetingTime\": \"10:00:00\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/field-officer/centres"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "2.4 Create Group",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('field_officer_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"groupName\": \"Pragati SHG\",\n  \"centreId\": {{centre_id}},\n  \"jointLiabilityEnabled\": true,\n  \"memberBorrowerIds\": []\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/field-officer/groups"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "2.5 Register Borrower (auto-provisions portal login)",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('field_officer_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Anjali Sharma\",\n  \"dateOfBirth\": \"1992-05-15\",\n  \"gender\": \"FEMALE\",\n  \"nationalIdNumber\": \"365111161247\",\n  \"village\": \"Village East\",\n  \"district\": \"South District\",\n  \"phone\": \"9876543210\",\n  \"occupation\": \"Micro Retailer\",\n  \"monthlyIncome\": 22000.00,\n  \"bankAccountNumber\": \"5010023456789\",\n  \"ifscCode\": \"HDFC0001234\",\n  \"portalEmail\": \"anjali.sharma@example.com\",\n  \"borrowerType\": \"GROUP\",\n  \"centreId\": {{centre_id}},\n  \"groupId\": {{group_id}}\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/field-officer/borrowers"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "2.6 Upload KYC Document (attach a file)",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('field_officer_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [
                    { "key": "documentType", "value": "NATIONAL_ID", "type": "text" },
                    { "key": "documentRef", "value": "AADHAAR-REF-3651", "type": "text" },
                    { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] }
                  ]
                },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/field-officer/borrowers/{{borrower_id}}/kyc"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Phase 3 · Credit Verification",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "3.1 Credit Officer Login",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{co_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{default_seed_password}}\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "3.2 Credit Officer Reset Password",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('reset_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{permanent_password}}\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/reset-password"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "3.3 Verify KYC",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('credit_officer_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"VERIFIED\",\n  \"remarks\": \"National ID verified against registry records.\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/credit-officer/kyc/{{kyc_id}}/verify"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Phase 4 · Origination & Underwriting",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "4.1 Field Officer Submit Loan Application",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('field_officer_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"borrowerId\": {{borrower_id}},\n  \"loanProductId\": {{loan_product_id}},\n  \"requestedAmount\": 30000.00,\n  \"purpose\": \"Inventory expansion for retail kiosk.\",\n  \"groupId\": {{group_id}}\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/loan-applications"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "4.2 Credit Officer Decision (APPROVE → issues sanction)",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('credit_officer_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"APPROVE\",\n  \"sanctionedAmount\": 30000.00,\n  \"override\": false,\n  \"overrideRemarks\": \"\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/credit-officer/applications/{{application_id}}/decision"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Phase 5 · Borrower Acceptance & Disbursal",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "5.1 Borrower Login",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{borrower_portal_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{default_seed_password}}\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "5.2 Borrower Reset Password",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('reset_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{permanent_password}}\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/reset-password"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "5.3 Borrower Accept Sanction (auto-disburse + schedule)",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('borrower_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [],
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/borrower/sanction-letters/{{sanction_id}}/accept"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Phase 6 · Collection Servicing",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "6.1 Field Officer Pull Repayment Schedule",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('field_officer_token'));"] } },
                { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": [
                  "var a = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (Array.isArray(a) && a.length) {",
                  "  var pending = a.filter(function (x) { return x.status === 'PENDING'; });",
                  "  pm.environment.set('schedule_id', (pending[0] || a[0]).scheduleId);",
                  "}"
                ] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/field-officer/loans/{{loan_account_id}}/schedule"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "6.2 Field Officer Record Collection",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('field_officer_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"loanAccountId\": {{loan_account_id}},\n  \"scheduleId\": {{schedule_id}},\n  \"collectedAmount\": 2700.00,\n  \"mode\": \"CENTRE_COLLECTION\"\n}" },
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/field-officer/collections"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "6.3 Borrower Approve Receipt (marks installment paid)",
              "event": [
                { "listen": "prerequest", "script": { "type": "javascript", "exec": ["pm.environment.set('current_token', pm.environment.get('borrower_token'));"] } }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [],
                "url": "{{base_url}}/api/borrower/receipts/{{receipt_id}}/approve"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
